{
  "name": "dsh-chang-kaishen-mode",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "常凯申模式：一个纯娱乐向的人物饰演开关，打开后自动向 AI 注入蒋介石（常凯申）角色扮演提示词。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "roleplay",
    "persona"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web",
      "external": [
        "react",
        "react/jsx-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "node_modules",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "comment": "node_modules 里是随包内置的两个运行期依赖（@deepseek-ai/schemastery 及其 @deepseek-ai/cosmokit）。宿主端插件以普通目录/符号链接形式挂载时，Node 会按真实路径解析裸模块名，因此插件必须自带这两项，不能依赖宿主提供。",
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cosmokit": "1.8.5",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "3.18.4"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
